    "description": "Individual Assignment 10.0%",
    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">IBC201 · Assessment 4/6</span>\n<h2>Individual Assignment</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13036 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">IBC201 · Đầu điểm 4/6</span>\n<h2>Individual Assignment</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13036 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">10.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">Option 1: Vary<br><br>Option 2 (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">LO1, LO2, LO3, LO4, LO5, LO6, LO7, LO8, LO9, LO10</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Question type / Dạng câu hỏi</span><span class=\"v\">Option 1: Each student is required to choose a country and perform the country overview. The report should include (but not limited) the following: 1. Brief country history: What significant events have affected each country today? Why? How?; What are the characteristics of the business culture? How does the culture of the country affect business? As international managers, what information is crucial to understand about the culture? What do we need to know in order to do business successfully in the country?2. Negotiations: How will we negotiate in your team’s chosen country? What tactics will be most effective to use? What are recommended negotiation strategies?<br><br>Option 2 (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">No. of questions / Số câu</span><span class=\"v\">Option 1: Maximum length of the individual assignment should be 5 pages excluding appendices</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">Option 1: Based on topics of studied units<br><br>Option 2 (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">Option 1: The wrirting report should be typed and double-spaced with 11-point font, and must be submitted via LMS. A deduction of 10% of the assignment mark will be applied for each day of late submission<br><br>Option 2 (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal<br><br>.</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Sessions in the plan that mention it</h3>\n<ul><li>Session 3 — Group Assignment Guidelines</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Buổi trong kế hoạch có nhắc tới</h3>\n<ul><li>Buổi 3 — Group Assignment Guidelines</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">🧪 Practice papers: <a href=\"/exam?course=IBC201\">Exam Room — IBC201</a> (3 papers: PE).</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">🧪 Đề luyện: <a href=\"/exam?course=IBC201\">Phòng thi — IBC201</a> (3 đề: PE).</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
